p><img title=\"oct oversea gossip\" alt=\"oct oversea gossip\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1450\" height=\"875\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/0ykIAFfG1wsaXySqTrwV2/ae58406280b409a49b11fcf3b050168d/198e4dac-2caf-4dfc-bd81-d38d766f5875.png?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/0ykIAFfG1wsaXySqTrwV2/ae58406280b409a49b11fcf3b050168d/198e4dac-2caf-4dfc-bd81-d38d766f5875.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/0ykIAFfG1wsaXySqTrwV2/ae58406280b409a49b11fcf3b050168d/198e4dac-2caf-4dfc-bd81-d38d766f5875.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/0ykIAFfG1wsaXySqTrwV2/ae58406280b409a49b11fcf3b050168d/198e4dac-2caf-4dfc-bd81-d38d766f5875.png?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/0ykIAFfG1wsaXySqTrwV2/ae58406280b409a49b11fcf3b050168d/198e4dac-2caf-4dfc-bd81-d38d766f5875.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/0ykIAFfG1wsaXySqTrwV2/ae58406280b409a49b11fcf3b050168d/198e4dac-2caf-4dfc-bd81-d38d766f5875.png?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/0ykIAFfG1wsaXySqTrwV2/ae58406280b409a49b11fcf3b050168d/198e4dac-2caf-4dfc-bd81-d38d766f5875.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/0ykIAFfG1wsaXySqTrwV2/ae58406280b409a49b11fcf3b050168d/198e4dac-2caf-4dfc-bd81-d38d766f5875.png?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/0ykIAFfG1wsaXySqTrwV2/ae58406280b409a49b11fcf3b050168d/198e4dac-2caf-4dfc-bd81-d38d766f5875.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/0ykIAFfG1wsaXySqTrwV2/ae58406280b409a49b11fcf3b050168d/198e4dac-2caf-4dfc-bd81-d38d766f5875.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">根据 Sensor Tower 数据，自2020年海外上线以来，《明日方舟》累计海外收入突破10亿美元。2026年10月，游戏海外收入创下下半年峰值，日本市场贡献了当月海外收入的64%。10月14日，《明日方舟》日服推出主线第17章“相变临界”，同步上线限定六星干员凯尔希·思衡托（Kal&#x27;tsit Esperanta）限时寻访及秋季庆典活动，涵盖庆典签到、免费寻访凭证及限定奖励等内容。版本更新后，游戏收入迅速攀升，荣登日本 iOS 手游畅销榜榜首。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">点点互动旗下4X策略新游《Lordrush》延续增长势头。上线仅3个月，该作海外月收入便在10月突破1200万美元，较9月增长60%。运营方面，游戏于10月27日推出万圣节活动“Halloween Party Invite”。10月30日，游戏单日收入创上线以来新高。本期排名较上月再升7位至第20名，同时位列收入增长榜第6名，成为点点互动旗下第三大4X策略产品。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">点点互动旗下4X策略新游《Top Force》于10月首次跻身中国手游出海收入榜。游戏以现代军事为题材，融合兵工厂经营、自动战斗与英雄养成等玩法。《Lordrush》与《Top Force》相继入榜，体现了点点互动在成熟4X策略框架下，通过不同题材和玩法设计以覆盖更广泛的策略游戏用户。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">益世界旗下4X策略游戏《疯狂水世界》（Wild Water World）首次入围本期中国出海手游收入Top 30。10月，该游戏海外收入环比增长50%，再创新高。韩国、日本和中国台湾市场收入均环比增长40%以上，其中，中国台湾增速领先，游戏于10月26日登上当地 iOS 手游畅销榜第2名。</p><hr/><h2 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 mui-1k89rjx\" data-testid=\"Text-h2\">10<!-- -->月出海手游收入增长榜</h2><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">10月，《Gossip Harbor》、《明日方舟》、《鸣潮》位列中国手游海外收入增长榜前三。</p><img title=\"oct oversea rev growth\" alt=\"oct oversea rev growth\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1894\" height=\"1390\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3DGY7J6iy1q3e0dNiOxYXk/56e17b77e920ef0e49697c1c86b2480c/10_cn_oversea_rev_growth.png?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3DGY7J6iy1q3e0dNiOxYXk/56e17b77e920ef0e49697c1c86b2480c/10_cn_oversea_rev_growth.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3DGY7J6iy1q3e0dNiOxYXk/56e17b77e920ef0e49697c1c86b2480c/10_cn_oversea_rev_growth.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3DGY7J6iy1q3e0dNiOxYXk/56e17b77e920ef0e49697c1c86b2480c/10_cn_oversea_rev_growth.png?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3DGY7J6iy1q3e0dNiOxYXk/56e17b77e920ef0e49697c1c86b2480c/10_cn_oversea_rev_growth.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3DGY7J6iy1q3e0dNiOxYXk/56e17b77e920ef0e49697c1c86b2480c/10_cn_oversea_rev_growth.png?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3DGY7J6iy1q3e0dNiOxYXk/56e17b77e920ef0e49697c1c86b2480c/10_cn_oversea_rev_growth.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3DGY7J6iy1q3e0dNiOxYXk/56e17b77e920ef0e49697c1c86b2480c/10_cn_oversea_rev_growth.png?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3DGY7J6iy1q3e0dNiOxYXk/56e17b77e920ef0e49697c1c86b2480c/10_cn_oversea_rev_growth.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3DGY7J6iy1q3e0dNiOxYXk/56e17b77e920ef0e49697c1c86b2480c/10_cn_oversea_rev_growth.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">腾讯天美研发、卡普空授权与监修的《怪物猎人：旅人》（Monster Hunter Outlanders）于10月29日在海外上线。游戏改编自经典主机游戏IP《怪物猎人》，玩家通过狩猎收集材料、制作装备，并可探索地图、建造设施和招募角色。上线仅3天，该游戏便位列本期中国手游海外收入增长榜第4名。在日本市场，游戏上线当日登上iOS手游畅销榜第3名，随后连续两日位居第2名。继《使命召唤手游》等产品之后，《怪物猎人：旅人》成为天美又一款在海外取得亮眼开局的IP改编手游。</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">《半夜别修仙》位列本期海外收入增长榜第8名。游戏融合修仙与午夜怪谈题材，玩家需要打造装备、学习功法，挑战各类鬼怪。该作最早于6月中旬在新加坡、马来西亚等市场小规模测试，9月下旬登陆中国台湾、中国香港等市场后，海外收入快速增长。10月13日至14日，游戏连续两天位居中国台湾iOS手游畅销榜第2名。</p><hr/><h2 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 mui-1k89rjx\" data-testid=\"Text-h2\">10<!-- -->月出海手游下载榜</h2><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">10月，中国手游出海下载榜前列仍以休闲益智游戏为主。《Block Blast!》继续位居榜首，《Brain Puzzle 2: Logic Twist》和《Meowdoku: Brain Puzzle Games》分别升至第2、第3位。Nebula Studio旗下新游《Rotate Rings》下载量环比增长334%，首次入榜。</p><img title=\"oct oversea downloads\" alt=\"oct oversea downloads\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1462\" height=\"1388\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2M3tOFAtXLlO4lB9zNIywq/54e5ee8337225d7fde9b8bbd821a5533/10_cn_oversea_down.png?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2M3tOFAtXLlO4lB9zNIywq/54e5ee8337225d7fde9b8bbd821a5533/10_cn_oversea_down.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2M3tOFAtXLlO4lB9zNIywq/54e5ee8337225d7fde9b8bbd821a5533/10_cn_oversea_down.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2M3tOFAtXLlO4lB9zNIywq/54e5ee8337225d7fde9b8bbd821a5533/10_cn_oversea_down.png?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2M3tOFAtXLlO4lB9zNIywq/54e5ee8337225d7fde9b8bbd821a5533/10_cn_oversea_down.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2M3tOFAtXLlO4lB9zNIywq/54e5ee8337225d7fde9b8bbd821a5533/10_cn_oversea_down.png?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2M3tOFAtXLlO4lB9zNIywq/54e5ee8337225d7fde9b8bbd821a5533/10_cn_oversea_down.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2M3tOFAtXLlO4lB9zNIywq/54e5ee8337225d7fde9b8bbd821a5533/10_cn_oversea_down.png?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2M3tOFAtXLlO4lB9zNIywq/54e5ee8337225d7fde9b8bbd821a5533/10_cn_oversea_down.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2M3tOFAtXLlO4lB9zNIywq/54e5ee8337225d7fde9b8bbd821a5533/10_cn_oversea_down.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">10月，Sensor Tower 旗下 Pathmatics 数字广告洞察显示，《Meowdoku》在美国市场的广告展示量环比增长约50%。当月，该游戏全球下载量突破1600万次，美国和巴西是主要增长市场，分别贡献当月全球下载量的22%和10%。此外，根据 Sensor Tower 广告变现洞察数据，《Meowdoku》位列10月全球手游广告收入榜第3，仅次于《Vita Mahjong》和《Block Blast!》。</p><img title=\"oct oversea downloads meow\" alt=\"oct oversea downloads meow\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1450\" height=\"875\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/BVQz0uck2TPdkiyDXYObk/ea1697ca227850b1294ce7aab2d45da5/Meowdoku.png?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/BVQz0uck2TPdkiyDXYObk/ea1697ca227850b1294ce7aab2d45da5/Meowdoku.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/BVQz0uck2TPdkiyDXYObk/ea1697ca227850b1294ce7aab2d45da5/Meowdoku.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/BVQz0uck2TPdkiyDXYObk/ea1697ca227850b1294ce7aab2d45da5/Meowdoku.png?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/BVQz0uck2TPdkiyDXYObk/ea1697ca227850b1294ce7aab2d45da5/Meowdoku.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/BVQz0uck2TPdkiyDXYObk/ea1697ca227850b1294ce7aab2d45da5/Meowdoku.png?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/BVQz0uck2TPdkiyDXYObk/ea1697ca227850b1294ce7aab2d45da5/Meowdoku.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/BVQz0uck2TPdkiyDXYObk/ea1697ca227850b1294ce7aab2d45da5/Meowdoku.png?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/BVQz0uck2TPdkiyDXYObk/ea1697ca227850b1294ce7aab2d45da5/Meowdoku.png